{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國傳媒周一（2日）報道，一份韓國總統專機「空軍一號」的乘客名單6月在網上被公開，當中包括總統李在明及160多名官員的護照資料。</p><p>韓國外交部周二（3日）表示，正調查資料外泄事件，並稱已為李在明等所有受影響官員更換護照，以及移除相關網站上的被泄資料。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:19.067404+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T09:12:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:10:03.622798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:39.186053+00:00","content_hash":"acc86cdc6496f3af3de8081f68791992bc3bf48a4e5d1e434f08f50ba46a90ff","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}